3. Reality Surfer Protocol

Your Reality Surfers deserve their own operator.

The world generates perturbations:

W_t

Model updates, new information, errors, opportunity, loss of context, user changes, API changes, market changes, adversarial conditions—these are all waves.

A brittle architecture tries to stop them.

A surfer attempts:

\boxed{
\text{detect wave}
\rightarrow
\text{estimate direction}
\rightarrow
\text{preserve invariants}
\rightarrow
\text{convert perturbation into motion}
