It asks:

What action converts this change into useful displacement?

Formally:

a^* =
\arg\max_a
[
\text{AgencyGain}(a,W_t)
-
\text{InvariantViolation}(a)
-
\text{TransitionCost}(a)
]

Canonical rule

Don’t demand a calm ocean. Build a better surfer.

